  "translation": "Weekend, the weather was very good. I went to the park with my friend. The flowers and trees inside the park were very pretty. We sat on a seat and chatted. Later, we could see a child running outside. My friend asked me: 'Who is that?' I said: 'That's a child.' At noon, we first brought lunch from home, then we ate lunch together, and we all ate happily. We didn't know whether to go to the library or go home. Finally, we went to the library. The library was very quiet, we read a book. In the evening, I went home to do homework and also reviewed my lessons."
